# Hexproof from black (CR 702.11d) also turns away abilities an opponent controls from black sources, and only an
# opponent's: Bot2's Bloodtithe Harvester (black and red) can't target Knight of Grace with its -X/-X ability, and
# targets Knight of Malice instead (hexproof from white is nothing to a black and red source), which dies as a 3/2
# getting -2/-2. While the Harvester, a black permanent, is on the battlefield, Knight of Grace is 3/2. Then Bot1 casts
# its own Fatal Push on its own Knight of Grace: its controller is not an opponent, so the black spell may target it.

